  "reading": "Across a 1152x range in FLOPs per call the residual spans only 12x, and 3x of that is the three smallest shapes. Excluding those, the residual is 22.4 us median with a 7.4 us spread. A rate deficit would have made the residual track the 1152x FLOP range; it does not. **The gap is dominated by a roughly FIXED per-call cost of about 22 us**, and over the recorded shapes it is 2.071 s of a modelled 3.141 s -- 66 % of their time.",
